      "Page": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Standard pagination inputs for admin list endpoints. Flatten this into a\nper-resource request struct alongside that resource's own filter fields:\n\n```ignore\n#[derive(Deserialize, ToSchema)]\npub struct ListThingsRequest {\n    #[serde(default)]\n    search: Option<String>,\n    #[serde(flatten)]\n    page: Page,\n}\n```",
        "properties": {
          "limit": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "int64",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "offset": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
